rule.docs:
Summary

- Name: useCollapsedIf
- Fix: safe
- Default severity: info
- Available from version: 1.9.4
- Diagnostic category: lint/style/useCollapsedIf


Description

 Enforce using single `if` instead of nested `if` clauses.

 If an `if (b)` statement is the only statement in an `if (a)` block, it is often clearer to use an `if (a && b)` form.

Examples

Invalid

 ```js,expect_diagnostic
 if (condition) {
     if (anotherCondition) {
         // ...
     }
 }
 ```

 ```js,expect_diagnostic
 if (condition) {
     // Comment
     if (anotherCondition) {
         // ...
     }
 }
 ```

Valid

 ```js
 if (condition && anotherCondition) {
     // ...
 }
 ```

 ```js
 if (condition) {
     if (anotherCondition) {
         // ...
     }
     doSomething();
 }
 ```

 ```js
 if (condition) {
     if (anotherCondition) {
         // ...
     } else {
         // ...
     }
 }
 ```

